    "turn_idx": 0,
    "turn_text": "This is AgriPulse OpenMic. I'm your host, Jeff Dally. This week's guest is Minnesota U.S. Senator Amy Klobuchar. AgriPulse OpenMic is brought to you by America's Cropageurist industry, providing individualized protection of more than 290 million acres of farmland. Cropageurist remains the smartest, most efficient way to secure America's food fiber and fuel supply. AgriPulse, overnight, continues with U.S. Senator Amy Klobuchar. Next. America's crop insurance industry is thankful for the continued support of farmers, commodity organizations, rural businesses, lenders, and lawmakers who are fighting to maintain a strong farm safety net. With crop prices falling, farm income plummeting, and Mother Nature wrecking havoc, the private sector crop insurance infrastructure is more important today than ever. providing individualized protection on more than 290 million acres of farmland, crop insurance remains the smartest, most efficient way to secure America's food, fiber, and fuel supply. This is AgriPulse Open Mike. With the completion of the Republican National Convention last week, the country's focus turns to Philadelphia and the Democratic National Convention. Agriculture trade and rule issues likely to be the subject matter for some of the week's debate. Minnesota U.S. Senator Amy Klobuchar will be among Democratic leaders this week who have points to share on the future of the country.",
