    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72778.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "A few weeks ago, we had Shirley Bloomfield, the CEO of the NTCA, the Rural Broadband Association, also on the same program. And she mentioned that rural broadband was also a part of education and economic development and even healthcare for rural communities.",
