  },
  {
    "episode_id": 72778,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72778.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Well, Global Market is very, very important to our ag producers. We've got, you know, we are in Minnesota first for sugarbeats and we are for sweet corn. We're second for hog, something that people are pretty surprised by. I think,",
